{
  "TitleJP": "ガール・オン・ファイアー ",
  "TitleKR": "걸 온 파이어 ",
  "TitleEN": "Girl on Fire ",
  "TitleTH": "Girl on Fire ",
  "TitleTW": "Girl on Fire",
  "DescJP": "ニューチャレンジをするとヒカリが持ってきたのは、激辛カレーだった。「無敵だから辛くない」と言うヒカリだったが――案の定、その辛さに悶絶する。それを心配した先生は牛乳とアイスクリームを買ってきてあげ、一緒に食べることに。その後、疲れたのかヒカリは先生の膝の上で寝てしまうのだった。",
  "DescKR": "치과에 다녀온 뒤 달달한 간식은 자제한다는 히카리. 대신 아주 매운 카레를 먹겠다는데……",
  "DescEN": "After going to her dental appointment, Hikari claims she'll cut down on sweets. She plans to replace them with very spicy curry.",
  "DescTH": "ฮิคาริเพิ่งกลับมาจากไปหาหมอฟันและบอกว่าเธอต้องงดขนมหวาน แต่จะกินแกงกะหรี่ที่เผ็ดระเบิดแทน...",
  "DescTW": "光看完牙醫後表示會克制吃甜食。不過，要吃非常辣的咖哩來代替甜食……",
  "DialogJP": [
    {
      "Text": "ガール・オン・ファイアー "
    },
    {
      "Text": "（どこか不安になるモモトークを受け取り、しばらくして……）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ヒカリ参上ー。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"こんにちは、ヒカリ。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"その手に持ってるのは……？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ヒカリの新しいチャレンジー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "限界を越えるアイテムー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ご覧あれー"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s3] \"これは……。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s4] \"激辛カレー？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "イエース、激辛ー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ヒカリ選手は今日から辛いものを食すー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "歯を守ってニューヒカリとなるー。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"せめて中辛とかで……\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "心の強さは体の強さー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "つまりヒカリは無敵ー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "無敵だから辛くない－。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"なるほど……。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "（心配をよそに、ヒカリはカレーを準備した）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "いくよー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "よゆー！ "
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"おおっ？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "……うう。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "よゆーじゃないかも……。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"辛さって後から来るよね……。\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ヒカリ、クリティカルー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "くちびる燃えるーいふぁいー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ふぇんふぇーへるふぅー……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ふぅぅーーはぁぁーーー……。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"息がもう辛い！\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"な、なにか買ってくるから待ってて！\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "（買ってきた牛乳をヒカリに渡した）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ふぅ、ふぅ……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "ふぅーーーー。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"落ち着いたかな……？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "うー、まだいだいー……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "持続ダメージ、100億くらい……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "もう辛いの食べない……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "心の強さなど無意味だったのだ……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "口の中燃えたー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "先生、甘いのあるー？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "まだ口からひ……。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s7] \"念のためアイスも買ってきたけど……。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s8] \"食べたら、ちゃんと歯磨きするんだよ？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "約束する、ヒカリちゃんと歯磨きするー。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ヒカリ",
      "Text": "先生もたべよー。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（アイスを食べたヒカリは疲れたのか、膝の上で眠りについた）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（……）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"これじゃ動けないな……。\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "（そのまま仕事が終わるまで寝かせてあげた）"
    }
  ],
  "DialogKR": [
    {
      "Text": "걸 온 파이어"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(뭔가 불안해지는 모모톡을 받고 시간이 지났다.)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "히카리 등장-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"안녕, 히카리.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"손에 들린 것은……?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "히카리의 새로운 도전."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "한계를 넘어 날아가기 위한 준비물-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "바로 이거야-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s3] \"이건……\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s4] \"아주 매운 카레??\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "응- 완전 매운맛 카레-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "오늘부터 히카리는 달콤함 대신 매운맛을 즐길래-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "치아도 지키고 뉴 히카리로 거듭난다-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"꽤 매울 텐데, 그거……\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "마음의 강함이 곧 육체의 강함."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "그런 의미로 히카리는 무적이니까-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "안 먹어봤지만 먹을 수 있어-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"과연……\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(걱정을 뒤로 하고, 히카리의 시식 준비가 끝났다.)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "자- 그럼-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "완전 여유-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"오오……\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "……우우……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "매워- 고통스러워-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"원래 매운 맛은 좀 늦게 오거든……\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "히카리 크리티컬 데미지-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "입술이 타오른다…… 아파……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "선생님- 살려줘어……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "후욱- 후욱- 하아- 하아-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"입김이 뜨겁고 매워……!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"도움이 될 만한 걸 사 올 테니까 조금만 기다려!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(서둘러 사 온 우유를 히카리에게 주었다.)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "후우- 후우-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "후우우우우-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"좀 괜찮아졌어……?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "우우…… 아직 아파-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "지속피해- 100억 정도……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "이제 매운 거 안 먹어……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "마음의 강함 따위 소용없었어……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "히카리의 육체 무력하게 무너졌어-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "선생님- 달콤한 거 있어-?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "아직 혀가 매워어……"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s7] \"혹시 몰라서 아이스크림도 사 왔는데……\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s8] \"이거 먹고 양치 잘 해야 한다?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "히카리 약속- 양치 잘하기-"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "히카리",
      "Text": "선생님도 같이 먹어-"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(아이스크림까지 먹은 히카리는 진이 빠졌는지 무릎 위로 올라와서 잠들었다.)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(……)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"못 움직이겠어…… \""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(결국 그대로 업무 시간이 끝날 때까지 자게 뒀다.)"
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Text": "Girl on Fire"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Some time after I received that somewhat-concerning MomoTalk message..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Hikari draws near!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"Hey, Hikari.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"What's that on your hand...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Hikari's new challenge."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Leveling up."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Look..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s3] \"This is...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s4] \"Super-spicy curry?!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Yes. Super-spicy curry."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "No more sweets. SPICY now."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Whole new Hikari. Much better teeth."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"That does look REALLY spicy, though...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Mind over matter."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Mental strength is invincibility."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "In theory. Pretty sure."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"I see...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "Without a hint of fear, Hikari faced down the curry."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Here goes..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Ha! No problem."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Wow...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "...Boo..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Hot. Painful."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Spicy foods sometimes take a little while to kick in...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Critical damage..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Lips...burning..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Sensei...help..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "*huff* *puff* *pant* *pant*"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"It's like you're breathing fire!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"I'll go get something to help you. Hang on!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "I ran off, bought milk, ran back, and handed it to her."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "*gasp* *gasp*"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "*wheeeeze*"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"You feeling better...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Boo... Still hurts..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Damage over time...about 10 billion..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "No more spicy food..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "\"Mental strength\" did nothing."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Hikari still went down without a fight."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "...Hey, Sensei, got any sweets?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Nothing hot. Tongue's still burning."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s7] \"I also bought ice cream, just in case...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s8] \"Brush your teeth after this, okay?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "Promise. Brushy-brushy."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "Hikari",
      "Text": "You have some too, Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Text": "She spent the last of her strength eating the ice cream. Then she climbed into my lap and fell asleep."
    },
    {
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"(I can't move...)\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(I ended up letting her sleep until my shift was over.)"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Text": "Girl on Fire"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(ผ่านไปสักพักหลังจากคุณครูได้รับ MOMOTALK ที่ทำให้ไม่สบายใจ)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮิคาริมาแล้ว"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1] \"สวัสดี ฮิคาริ เอาอะไรมาน่ะ?\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2] \"ว่าไง ฮิคาริ เอาอะไรติดมือมาน่ะ?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "การท้าทายครั้งใหม่ของฮิคาริ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ของที่เตรียมมาเพื่อก้าวข้ามขีดจำกัด"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ก็คืออันนี้ไง"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s3] \"นี่มัน... แกงกะหรี่รสเผ็ดจัด?\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s4] \"แกงกะหรี่รสเผ็ดจัดนี่นา??\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "อื้อ เผ็ดสุดๆ เลยละ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ตั้งแต่วันนี้ ฮิคาริจะเปิดใจให้รสเผ็ดแทนรสหวาน"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "เพื่อปกป้องฟัน และเพื่อเป็นฮิคาริคนใหม่"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"แต่นั่นมันน่าจะเผ็ดมากเลยนะ...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ความเข้มแข็งของจิตใจคือความแข็งแกร่งของร่างกาย"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮิคาริอยู่ยงคงกระพันอยู่แล้ว"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ถึงจะไม่เคยกินมาก่อน แต่ก็กินได้น่า"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"จริงนะ...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(แล้วฮิคาริก็พร้อมชิมอาหาร ส่วนคุณครูก็ทิ้งความกังวลไปก่อน)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "เอาละ ถ้างั้น..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ก็กินแบบชิลๆ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"โอ้วว...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "โอย..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "เผ็ด เผ็ดจนใจเจ็บเลย"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ปกติรสเผ็ดมันจะมาช้าหน่อยน่ะ...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮิคาริ โดน คริติคอล ดาเมจ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ปากร้อนผ่าวไปหมดเลย... แสบปากง่า..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "คุณครู ช่วยด้วย..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮู่... ฮู่... ฮ่า... ฮ่า..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5] \"ขนาดลมหายใจยังเผ็ดร้อนเลย...!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6] \"รอก่อนนะ ครูจะไปซื้อของมาช่วยเอง!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(คุณครูรีบยื่นนมที่ซื้อมาให้ฮิคาริ)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮู่ว... ฮู่ว..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮู่ววววว..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"รู้สึกดีขึ้นบ้างมั้ย?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "โอย... ยังแสบอยู่เลย..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ความเสียหายต่อเนื่อง ราวๆ 10 พันล้าน..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "จะไม่กินของเผ็ดอีกแล้ว..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "จิตใจแข็งแกร่งไปก็ไม่มีประโยชน์..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ร่างกายของฮิคาริอ่อนแอไม่ไหวแล้ว"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "คุณครู มีอะไรหวานๆ บ้างมั้ย?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ลิ้นฮิคาริยังเผ็ดอยู่เลย..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s7] \"ที่จริงก็มีไอศกรีมด้วย แต่กินแล้วต้องแปรงฟันนะ...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s8] \"มีไอศกรีมด้วย แต่กินแล้วต้องแปรงฟันให้สะอาดนะ...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "ฮิคาริสัญญา จะตั้งใจแปรงฟันเลย"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "ฮิคาริ",
      "Text": "คุณครูก็กินด้วยกันสิ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(ฮิคาริกินไอศกรีมหมดและคงหมดแรง จึงมาผล็อยหลับอยู่บนตักของคุณครู)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "(...)"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"ขยับไม่ได้เลย...\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "(สุดท้ายคุณครูก็ปล่อยให้ฮิคารินอนจนกว่าจะเลิกงาน)"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTW": [
    {
      "Text": "Girl on Fire"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（收到讓人不安的MomoTalk後，過了一段時間）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "光登場～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s1]「嗨，光。」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s2]「你手上拿的是……？」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "是光的新挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "為了突破極限準備的東西～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "就是這個～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s3]「這是……」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s4]「超辣咖哩？」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "嗯～是究極辣味咖哩～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "之後光要戒掉甜食，享受辣味～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "保護牙齒，重生為New光～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「看起來就超辣的……」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "心靈的強大，就代表肉體的強大。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "所以光是無敵的～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "雖然沒有吃過，但光敢吃～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「真的嗎……」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（光把擔心拋在腦後，完成了試吃準備）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "來～開動～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "輕輕鬆鬆～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「哦哦……」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "嗚嗚……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "好辣～好痛哦～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「辣味本來就是幾秒後才會有感覺……」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "光受到了暴擊～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "嘴唇要燒起來了……好痛好痛……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "老師～救命……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "呼～哈～呼～哈～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s5]「感覺連呼吸都是辣的……！」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s6]「我去買點能解辣的東西，等我一下！」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（連忙去幫光買了牛奶回來）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "呼～呼～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "呼～～～～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「好一點了嗎……？」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "嗚嗚……還是好痛～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "持續傷害，大概有100億……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "以後不吃辣了……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "心靈的強大根本沒用……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "光的肉體已經崩潰了～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "老師～有甜的東西嗎～？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "我的舌頭還是好辣……"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s7]「為了以防萬一，我還買了冰淇淋回來……」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s8]「吃完要好好刷牙喔？」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "光跟你打勾勾～會好好刷牙～"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4254046605,
      "Name": "光",
      "Text": "老師也一起吃吧～"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（吃完冰淇淋之後，光似乎因為疲累而躺在膝蓋上睡著了）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（……）"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns]「動彈不得……」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "（就這樣讓他一直睡到工作時間結束為止）"
    }
  ]
